  "title": "Media found more routes home",
  "summary": "Media, agents, and model discovery became easier to connect, inspect, and build on.\n\nGenerated image, video, audio, and 3D files moved to Media storage, so returned URLs can retrieve a stored result without generating it again. Image generation and editing gained a URL response option. Supported media models also became callable through Chat Completions and Responses, returning public media links; supported image and video routes accept image inputs for edits or start frames.\n\nPublic GitHub repositories with a root-level agent.ts can now become callable code agents. Computer MCP gives agents a private filesystem that persists between runs and a bash tool. Polli gained repository search, code tracing, and page rendering, while agent tool failures became easier to see and handle.\n\nPublic model IDs were standardized as lowercase publisher/model names, and community models gained community/owner/model catalog and permission IDs; existing names remain generation aliases. Model discovery now reports supported Chat parameters, and generation requests can provide an ordered fallback chain of up to four models. New options include GPT Image 2.5 Flare and Sunburst, image-to-3D Gaussian splats, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, and 1080p MiniMax video.\n\nUsage by model and earnings by source now have breakdown tables, independent date controls, filters, chart-to-table navigation, and CSV exports. Wallet balances remain visible while earnings load. Eligible low-balance text requests can return an unbilled notice, and payment links now lead to the wallet top-up or relevant API-key editor.",
  "pr_count": 100,
